{"seq":1,"slug":"presale-inventory-separation-allocation","title":"预售/现货库存隔离与预留","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/presale-inventory-separation-allocation","wordCount":2286,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"预售-现货库存隔离与预留\">预售/现货库存隔离与预留</h1><p>现货库存是一个已经存在的数字，预售库存是一个<strong>未来的承诺</strong>。把它们塞进同一张可售库存表，是预售系统最经典的结构性错误：一旦两条业务线共用一个 <code>available_qty</code>，就会出现&quot;预售卖掉了还没到货的量，现货卖掉了本该留给预售的量&quot;，而且两者的超卖表现相反——现货超卖是立即发货失败，预售超卖是几个月后交付失败，后者的成本高得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>正确的做法是按<strong>可售性的来源</strong>分账。同一件实物 SKU，在任意时刻会同时存在多个互相排斥的可售口径，每个口径由一个独立的供应来源支撑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S[供应商/产线] --&gt;|已到货| W[实物在库&lt;br/&gt;on_hand]&#10;    S --&gt;|未来批次| F[未来到货批次&lt;br/&gt;inbound batch]&#10;    W --&gt; A1[现货可售&lt;br/&gt;stock_available]&#10;    W --&gt; A2[预售预留&lt;br/&gt;reserved_for_presale]&#10;    F --&gt; A3[预售可售&lt;br/&gt;presale_available]&#10;    A1 --&gt; O1[现货订单]&#10;    A2 --&gt; O2[已付定金订单]&#10;    A3 --&gt; O3[新预售订单]\">graph TD\n    S[供应商/产线] --&gt;|已到货| W[实物在库&lt;br/&gt;on_hand]\n    S --&gt;|未来批次| F[未来到货批次&lt;br/&gt;inbound batch]\n    W --&gt; A1[现货可售&lt;br/&gt;stock_available]\n    W --&gt; A2[预售预留&lt;br/&gt;reserved_for_presale]\n    F --&gt; A3[预售可售&lt;br/&gt;presale_available]\n    A1 --&gt; O1[现货订单]\n    A2 --&gt; O2[已付定金订单]\n    A3 --&gt; O3[新预售订单]</pre><p>三个口径的关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>on_hand</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>stock_available</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>reserved_for_presale</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{on\\_hand} \\ge \\text{stock\\_available} + \\text{reserved\\_for\\_presale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">on_hand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stock_available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserved_for_presale</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>presale_available</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>未承诺批次</mtext></munder><mtext>batch_qty</mtext><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>预售订单</mtext></munder><mtext>committed_qty</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{presale\\_available} = \\sum_{\\text{未承诺批次}} \\text{batch\\_qty} - \\sum_{\\text{预售订单}} \\text{committed\\_qty}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">presale_available</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">未承诺批次</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">batch_qty</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3443em;vertical-align:-1.2943em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">预售订单</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed_qty</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这两条不变式必须由数据库约束或事务保证，而不是靠应用层&quot;记得检查&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预留模型-从计数到明细\">预留模型：从计数到明细</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能用单一计数\">为什么不能用单一计数</h3><p>最常见的偷懒实现是在 SKU 表上加一个 <code>reserved_qty</code> 字段，下单时 <code>+1</code>，取消时 <code>-1</code>。它的问题是<strong>无法归因</strong>：当预留数量与订单数量对不上时，你不知道该退给谁；当预留需要按时释放（超时未付尾款）时，计数模型没有时间信息。</p>\n<p>正确模型是保留一条<strong>预留明细</strong>，计数只是它的聚合视图。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inventory_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku             TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  source_kind     TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (source_kind IN (&#39;STOCK&#39;, &#39;INBOUND_BATCH&#39;)),&#10;  batch_id        BIGINT,&#10;  order_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  qty             INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (qty &gt; 0),&#10;  state           TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN&#10;                    (&#39;HELD&#39;, &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;, &#39;RELEASED&#39;, &#39;EXPIRED&#39;, &#39;CONSUMED&#39;)),&#10;  held_at         TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  expires_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  released_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_batch_required&#10;    CHECK (source_kind = &#39;STOCK&#39; OR batch_id IS NOT NULL)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_reservation_order_source&#10;  ON inventory_reservation (order_id, sku, source_kind, COALESCE(batch_id, 0))&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;HELD&#39;, &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_kind     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'STOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INBOUND_BATCH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONSUMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  held_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_batch_required</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (source_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'STOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_reservation_order_source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_reservation (order_id, sku, source_kind, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后那个部分唯一索引是这张表的核心防护：<strong>同一订单对同一来源只能有一条活跃预留</strong>。它把&quot;重复下单导致重复预留&quot;这类幂等事故挡在数据库层，应用层的重试逻辑无论跑多少次都只会有一条记录。<code>COALESCE(batch_id, 0)</code> 是因为 PostgreSQL 的唯一索引中 NULL 不相等，直接用 <code>batch_id</code> 会让 <code>STOCK</code> 来源的重复预留逃过约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预留的生命周期\">预留的生命周期</h3><p>预留有五个状态，迁移由明确的事件驱动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>从</th>\n<th>到</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>HELD</td>\n<td>下单/付定金</td>\n<td>占用未来批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HELD</td>\n<td>CONFIRMED</td>\n<td>尾款支付成功</td>\n<td>转为确定性需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HELD</td>\n<td>EXPIRED</td>\n<td>尾款窗口关闭</td>\n<td>释放，回到可售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HELD</td>\n<td>RELEASED</td>\n<td>用户取消</td>\n<td>释放，可能触发退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONFIRMED</td>\n<td>CONSUMED</td>\n<td>发货</td>\n<td>从批次实际扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CONFIRMED</td>\n<td>RELEASED</td>\n<td>发货前取消/退款</td>\n<td>释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 <code>EXPIRED</code> 与 <code>RELEASED</code> 是两个不同的状态。它们在库存效果上相同（都释放），但在资金和报表上完全不同：<code>EXPIRED</code> 意味着用户弃付（定金可能被没收），<code>RELEASED</code> 意味着用户主动取消（通常全额退）。把这个区别保留在状态里，第 4 章的弃付率指标才能算得出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; HELD: 支付定金&#10;    HELD --&gt; CONFIRMED: 尾款成功&#10;    HELD --&gt; EXPIRED: 窗口超时&#10;    HELD --&gt; RELEASED: 用户取消&#10;    CONFIRMED --&gt; CONSUMED: 发货&#10;    CONFIRMED --&gt; RELEASED: 发货前取消&#10;    EXPIRED --&gt; [*]&#10;    RELEASED --&gt; [*]&#10;    CONSUMED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; HELD: 支付定金\n    HELD --&gt; CONFIRMED: 尾款成功\n    HELD --&gt; EXPIRED: 窗口超时\n    HELD --&gt; RELEASED: 用户取消\n    CONFIRMED --&gt; CONSUMED: 发货\n    CONFIRMED --&gt; RELEASED: 发货前取消\n    EXPIRED --&gt; [*]\n    RELEASED --&gt; [*]\n    CONSUMED --&gt; [*]</pre><h3 id=\"过期释放的执行\">过期释放的执行</h3><p><code>expires_at</code> 到期后必须有人去改状态。两种做法：定时扫描，或者<strong>惰性判定</strong>。定时扫描简单但会与&quot;用户在过期前最后一秒支付&quot;发生竞态；惰性判定（在读取可售量时把已过期但未置位的预留视为已释放）避免了竞态，但会让&quot;可售量&quot;的计算变复杂。</p>\n<p>生产上通常两者结合：扫描任务负责最终一致性（把过期行真正置为 <code>EXPIRED</code>），而所有读取可售量的查询在条件里带上 <code>expires_at &gt; now()</code>，使竞态窗口不会影响可售量。这样即使扫描任务挂了十分钟，可售量仍然是正确的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  b.batch_id,&#10;  b.batch_qty - COALESCE(r.committed, 0) AS available_qty&#10;FROM inbound_batch b&#10;LEFT JOIN LATERAL (&#10;  SELECT SUM(r.qty) AS committed&#10;  FROM inventory_reservation r&#10;  WHERE r.batch_id = b.batch_id&#10;    AND r.state IN (&#39;HELD&#39;, &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;)&#10;    AND (r.expires_at IS NULL OR r.expires_at &gt; now())&#10;) r ON TRUE&#10;WHERE b.sku = $1&#10;  AND b.status = &#39;PLANNED&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_qty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">committed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound_batch b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LATERAL (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> committed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_reservation r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TRUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PLANNED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>expires_at &gt; now()</code> 这个条件就是惰性判定；它让扫描任务的延迟不影响正确性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离策略-硬隔离与软隔离\">隔离策略：硬隔离与软隔离</h2><h3 id=\"硬隔离-批次专供\">硬隔离：批次专供</h3><p>硬隔离指把某些到货批次<strong>标记为预售专用</strong>，现货销售完全看不到它们。它的好处是两种业务的库存数字互相独立、互不干扰，预售超卖与现货超卖不会互相放大。代价是灵活性差：如果预售没卖完，剩余批次也不能用于现货，只能走清仓（对应 <code>167_inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing</code> 的处理）。</p>\n<p>硬隔离适合：定制商品（预售的货与现货的货本来就不同）、独占发行（限定版）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"软隔离-共享池加优先级\">软隔离：共享池加优先级</h3><p>软隔离指两种业务共用一个供应池，但通过优先级规则决定冲突时谁先拿货。常见规则是&quot;已确认的预售订单优先于现货订单&quot;，因为预售用户已经等待了更久、违约的法律后果更重。</p>\n<p>软隔离适合：同一 SKU 同时有现货与预售渠道的常规品。它的实现要点是把优先级表达在扣减查询的排序里，而不是散在多个 <code>if</code> 中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH ranked_demand AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    order_id,&#10;    qty,&#10;    CASE WHEN order_type = &#39;PRESALE_CONFIRMED&#39; THEN 1&#10;         WHEN order_type = &#39;PRESALE_HELD&#39;      THEN 2&#10;         ELSE 3 END AS priority&#10;  FROM order_demand&#10;  WHERE sku = $1 AND state = &#39;PENDING&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT order_id&#10;FROM ranked_demand&#10;ORDER BY priority, order_id&#10;LIMIT $2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked_demand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PRESALE_CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PRESALE_HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_demand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked_demand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority, order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"两种策略的对比\">两种策略的对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>硬隔离</th>\n<th>软隔离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超卖耦合</td>\n<td>无，互不影响</td>\n<td>有，一方挤占另一方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存利用率</td>\n<td>低，冗余多</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低（加个标记）</td>\n<td>高（优先级 + 冲突处理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>定制/独占/高价值</td>\n<td>常规品、双渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出问题时的爆炸半径</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型建议是<strong>默认硬隔离，只有在库存压力明确存在且超卖成本可控时才引入软隔离</strong>。反过来做（先软隔离，出问题再隔离）会把一个已经是全局故障的事故追责变得极其困难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨仓与跨境的额外维度\">跨仓与跨境的额外维度</h2><p>跨境预售的库存隔离还要处理一个维度：<strong>在哪个国家承诺交付</strong>。同一批货可能从国内直发、也可能从海外仓发货（对应 <code>078_overseas-warehouse-wms</code> 与 <code>022_international-pricing-currency</code> 的处理）。库存隔离因此不是二维（预售/现货）而是三维（预售/现货 × 供应来源 × 交付市场）。</p>\n<p>这个维度不能被忽略，因为<strong>监管约束与交付承诺是按市场不同的</strong>：欧盟的默认交付期限、目的国的进口合规要求、海外仓的可用仓位，都会限制某批货能卖给哪个市场。把交付市场作为预留的一个属性，可以让&quot;这批货能不能发给这个用户&quot;成为一个可判定的谓词。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;reservation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;reservation_id&quot;: 8817723,&#10;    &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;SKU-9F21&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source&quot;: { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;INBOUND_BATCH&quot;, &quot;batch_id&quot;: 4410, &quot;eta&quot;: &quot;2026-11-20&quot; },&#10;    &quot;delivery_market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;fulfillment_node&quot;: &quot;WH-DE-02&quot;,&#10;    &quot;qty&quot;: 1,&#10;    &quot;state&quot;: &quot;HELD&quot;,&#10;    &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-08T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reservation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reservation_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8817723</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-9F21\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INBOUND_BATCH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"batch_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4410</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"eta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"delivery_market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fulfillment_node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WH-DE-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HELD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-08T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见事故与防护\">常见事故与防护</h2><p>三类事故反复出现。第一类是<strong>双写不一致</strong>：订单服务与库存服务各自维护一份预留，网络分区时两边数量不同。防护是让库存服务成为预留的唯一权威，订单侧只保存 <code>reservation_id</code>。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>释放遗漏</strong>：订单被取消但预留没释放，导致可售量长期虚低。防护是建立&quot;活跃预留必须对应一个活跃订单&quot;的对账任务，每日比对并告警。</p>\n<p>第三类是<strong>预留穿透</strong>：绕过预留直接扣减实物库存。防护是让发货路径强制校验 <code>reservation.state = &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;</code>，把绕过预留变成一次数据库层面的失败而不是一次静默的错误。这三类事故的共同根源是同一份实物被多处以不同口径记账，因此修复方向始终是收敛权威而不是增加校验。</p>\n<p>并发写入的可售量本身也需要防护。PostgreSQL 的行级锁不对普通查询加锁，只阻塞写者与其他加锁者，因此&quot;读可售量 → 判断够不够 → 写入预留&quot;这个三步序列在并发下会读到过期值。标准解法是在同一事务内对批次行加锁并保持一致的加锁顺序以避免死锁（PostgreSQL 明确建议按应用范围内统一的顺序获取多行锁，并在检测到死锁中止后重试整个事务，见 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-locking.html\">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-locking.html</a> ）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;&#10;SELECT batch_id, batch_qty&#10;FROM inbound_batch&#10;WHERE batch_id = ANY($1::bigint[])&#10;ORDER BY batch_id&#10;FOR UPDATE;&#10;&#10;UPDATE inbound_batch&#10;SET reserved_qty = reserved_qty + $2&#10;WHERE batch_id = $3&#10;  AND batch_qty - reserved_qty &gt;= $2;&#10;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id, batch_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound_batch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound_batch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ORDER BY batch_id ... FOR UPDATE</code> 与文档给出的死锁规避写法一致：所有涉及多行的加锁路径都按同一个键序加锁，任意两个并发事务就不会形成环。<code>AND batch_qty - reserved_qty &gt;= $2</code> 把&quot;库存够不够&quot;的判断放进 UPDATE 的谓词里，让判断与写入成为一次原子操作——这比先 <code>SELECT</code> 判断再 <code>UPDATE</code> 少一次竞态窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>同一 SKU 的现货可售与预售可售必须分账，由不同供应来源支撑。</li>\n<li>预留要保留明细而非单一计数，明细才可归因、可超时、可对账。</li>\n<li>部分唯一索引把&quot;重复预留&quot;挡在数据库层，<code>COALESCE(batch_id, 0)</code> 用来绕开 PostgreSQL 唯一索引对 NULL 的宽松处理。</li>\n<li><code>EXPIRED</code> 与 <code>RELEASED</code> 必须在状态上区分，否则无法计算弃付率。</li>\n<li>惰性判定（<code>expires_at &gt; now()</code>）让过期扫描任务的延迟不影响可售量正确性。</li>\n<li>硬隔离优先于软隔离，软隔离只在库存压力明确、超卖成本可控时使用。</li>\n<li>跨境场景下预留需要第三个维度：交付市场与履约节点。</li>\n<li>让库存服务成为预留的唯一权威，并建立活跃预留与活跃订单的对账。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>拿到一个批次后如何换算成对外的发货承诺，见 <a href=\"production-leadtime-delivery-promise\">生产周期与发货承诺</a>；这些预留状态如何挂在订单状态机上，见 <a href=\"presale-order-state-machine\">预售订单状态机与尾款支付</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预售/现货库存隔离与预留","id":"预售-现货库存隔离与预留"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预留模型：从计数到明细","id":"预留模型-从计数到明细"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能用单一计数","id":"为什么不能用单一计数"},{"level":3,"text":"预留的生命周期","id":"预留的生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"过期释放的执行","id":"过期释放的执行"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离策略：硬隔离与软隔离","id":"隔离策略-硬隔离与软隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"硬隔离：批次专供","id":"硬隔离-批次专供"},{"level":3,"text":"软隔离：共享池加优先级","id":"软隔离-共享池加优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"两种策略的对比","id":"两种策略的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"跨仓与跨境的额外维度","id":"跨仓与跨境的额外维度"},{"level":2,"text":"常见事故与防护","id":"常见事故与防护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"锁单价保与需求聚合（联 142 C2M）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-model/price-lock-demand-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"生产周期与发货承诺（ATP）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/production-leadtime-delivery-promise"}}